le=\"font-size:14px;\">可加LINE詢問<br /></span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">1.近南港軟體園區、世貿南港館、中研院，離南港火車站、捷運南港站走路約6分鐘。</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">2.附全套傢俱(冷氣、洗衣機、液晶電視、冰箱、雙人床組)…，大窗戶採光通風佳，交通方便，生活機能全。&nbsp;</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">3.附近有站牌、捷運站、交流道、市場、學校。&nbsp;</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">4.水泥牆隔間隔音佳,有對外窗。&nbsp;</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">5.無管理費，租金包含光纖網路、水費、&nbsp;第四台，(電費一度5元)。&nbsp;</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">6.為維護房客生活品質，室內不可抽煙,不可養寵物，打麻將，會於租約中註明違約扣兩個月押金並限期搬遷。&nbsp;</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">******************************&nbsp;</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">儲熱式電熱水器(防漏電裝置)、獨立洗衣機、獨立晾衣、氣密隔音窗、</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">防火隔熱天花板、分戶安全開關電箱、雙人床組、滅火器、逃生窗</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">******************************</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">附近有便利商店、百貨公司、公園綠地、醫療機構、學校。</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial, 微軟正黑體, \"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">本房屋近南港捷運站。</span></span>\r\n附近有便利商店、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構。\r\n本房屋近南港捷運站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "南港區東明街1巷23號", "lat": "25.0567390", "lng": "121.6042700", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "subway